    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb, fall and try again</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a physics-based, 2.5D platforming game where your goal is to\u00a0<strong>get to the top</strong>. But the path is anything but easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With precise jumps and an unforgiving environment, this game is built for those who chase the satisfaction of progress earned through skill and persistence. Every fall is a lesson. Every step higher is a small victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're casually playing looking for a challenge as a speed runner, the experience is built to be fair, fast and focused, with increased difficulty as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>New Game+ and Special Modes:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've conquered the climb, it doesn\u2019t end there. Unlock a tougher version of the core game with\u00a0<strong>special gameplay modifiers (</strong>that change how you move, jump, or see the world<strong>)</strong> and<strong> time trials.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\ud83d\udee0 LEVEL EDITOR - Coming Soon:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A diverse\u00a0<strong>in-game level editor</strong> is in development, allowing you to design, test, and share your own stages. Challenge your friends,  test your own abilities and see what you can create!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726480/extras/a721bcfacb25613308920f6d97fc9467.poster.avif?t=1749769843\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726480/extras/a721bcfacb25613308920f6d97fc9467.webm?t=1749769843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726480/extras/a721bcfacb25613308920f6d97fc9467.mp4?t=1749769843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\ud83c\udfae Key Features:</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based, 2.5D precision platforming - </strong>vertically,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smooth performance -</strong> on all sorts of hardware,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized visuals -</strong> with occlusion culling and optimized assets,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist, responsive controls</strong>,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No checkpoints -\u00a0</strong>one mistake and you're done,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level editor (coming soon!) -</strong> for community-made content and endless fun,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed-runner Friendly</strong>\u00a0- In-game timers and achievements</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb, fall and try again</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a physics-based, 2.5D platforming game where your goal is to\u00a0<strong>get to the top</strong>. But the path is anything but easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With precise jumps and an unforgiving environment, this game is built for those who chase the satisfaction of progress earned through skill and persistence. Every fall is a lesson. Every step higher is a small victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're casually playing looking for a challenge as a speed runner, the experience is built to be fair, fast and focused, with increased difficulty as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>New Game+ and Special Modes:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've conquered the climb, it doesn\u2019t end there. Unlock a tougher version of the core game with\u00a0<strong>special gameplay modifiers (</strong>that change how you move, jump, or see the world<strong>)</strong> and<strong> time trials.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\ud83d\udee0 LEVEL EDITOR - Coming Soon:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A diverse\u00a0<strong>in-game level editor</strong> is in development, allowing you to design, test, and share your own stages. Challenge your friends,  test your own abilities and see what you can create!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726480/extras/a721bcfacb25613308920f6d97fc9467.poster.avif?t=1749769843\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726480/extras/a721bcfacb25613308920f6d97fc9467.webm?t=1749769843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726480/extras/a721bcfacb25613308920f6d97fc9467.mp4?t=1749769843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\ud83c\udfae Key Features:</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based, 2.5D precision platforming - </strong>vertically,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smooth performance -</strong> on all sorts of hardware,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized visuals -</strong> with occlusion culling and optimized assets,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist, responsive controls</strong>,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No checkpoints -\u00a0</strong>one mistake and you're done,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level editor (coming soon!) -</strong> for community-made content and endless fun,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed-runner Friendly</strong>\u00a0- In-game timers and achievements</p></li></ul>",
